  "question": {
    "text": "The remainder, when $7^{103}$ is divided by 23 , is equal to :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "2qzUb",
      "text": "6",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "qNrXM",
      "text": "17",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "8up0Z",
      "text": "9",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "SGccc",
      "text": "14",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& 7^{103}=7\\left(7^{102}\\right)=7(343)^{34}=7(345-2)^{34} \\\\\n& 7^{103}=23 \\mathrm{~K}_1+7.2^{34}\n\\end{aligned}$\n\nNow $7.2^{34}=7.2^2 \\cdot 2^{32}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& =28 \\cdot(256)^4 \\\\\n& =28(253+3)^4 \\\\\n& \\therefore 28 \\times 81 \\Rightarrow(23+5)(69+12) \\\\\n& 23 \\mathrm{~K}_2+60 \\\\\n& \\therefore \\text { Remainder }=14\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
